      "text": "Whereas the Department had published E-tender vide F.No.31/27/2022-E&F(SIA) dated 03.02.2022 for the empanelment of agencies to conduct Social Impact Assessment studies at Lakshadweep as per the various provisions in the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act-2013 (30 Of 2013) and Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement (Social Impact Assessment & Consent) Rules 2014."
    },
