      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 11,
      "poly": [
        74.38,
        265.23,
        560.49,
        265.23,
        560.49,
        305.65,
        74.38,
        305.65
      ],
      "text": "And whereas the last date for accepting this tender was 15.02.2022. Now in order to have wider participation for this tender, the time schedule described at para 8.1 had been rescheduled as below."
    },
